OL,3,GNEWSASuspected fly-tipped debris leaves
OL,4,Abiker injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcrete and rubble, suspected to be
OL,7,Ffly-tipped debris, has left a
OL,8,Fmotorcyclist seriously injured.
OL,10,FThe incident happened on 29 July when
OL,11,Fthe rider was travelling on Quay Lane
OL,12,Fin Earl's Croome, Worcestershire, at
OL,13,Fabout 23:50 BST.
OL,15,FA West Mercia Police spokesperson said:
OL,16,F"The debris, which included concrete
OL,17,Fand rubble, is believed to have been
OL,18,Ffly-tipped. The victim suffered a
OL,19,Fserious injury but is recovering."
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
